        "text": "<p class=\"text-1\">Modern life doesn’t slow down. Long workdays, constant notifications, disrupted sleep, and nonstop mental load keep your nervous system stuck in “on” mode.<br><br>\n\nMost stress solutions either numb you, overstimulate you or only work temporarily. What’s missing is <b>support for how your body adapts to everyday stress—without sedation or burnout.</b><br><br>\n\nThat’s where <b>Tribe Organics Ashwagandha KSM-66<sup>®</sup></b> comes in.</p>",
        "title_2": "WHAT MAKES THIS DIFFERENT",
        "text_2": "<p class=\"text-2\"><b>Tribe Organics Ashwagandha KSM-66<sup>®</sup></b> is formulated with <b>the exact clinically studied dose</b> of the world’s most researched Ashwagandha extract—designed for daily use by people living high-pressure lives.*<br><br>\n\nNo adulteration. No shortcuts. No guesswork.\n<br><br>\nJust clean, clinically grounded stress support you can rely on.<sup>*</sup></p>",
